Subject: [PATCH 1820/3799] soh: rename func_809A9E28 ->
 EffectSsKakera_DragSquared

Name source: DEDUCED from the code (confidence HIGH) -- zeldaret/oot
leaves this symbol address-named too, so there is no upstream name to adopt.
Reason: the same falloff against the squared distance.
Defined in soh/src/overlays/effects/ovl_Effect_Ss_Kakera/z_eff_ss_kakera.c.

Tagged [LLM:HIGH] at the definition, every declaration and every call site, so a
reader meeting the name anywhere knows it is inferred.
---
 .../effects/ovl_Effect_Ss_Kakera/z_eff_ss_kakera.c       | 9 +++++----
 1 file changed, 5 insertions(+), 4 deletions(-)

diff --git a/soh/src/overlays/effects/ovl_Effect_Ss_Kakera/z_eff_ss_kakera.c b/soh/src/overlays/effects/ovl_Effect_Ss_Kakera/z_eff_ss_kakera.c
